WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.473 --> 00:00:03.481
打开Rules / Open Rules

2
00:00:03.481 --> 00:00:06.587
创建Guide mapping / Create Guide mapping

3
00:00:06.587 --> 00:00:09.585
限定原请求Host为localhost / Restrict the original Host to localhost

4
00:00:09.585 --> 00:00:13.013
添加Path条件 / Add a Path condition

5
00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:16.027
限定演示前缀 / Restrict the example prefix

6
00:00:16.027 --> 00:00:19.059
移除默认Header动作 / Remove the default Header action

7
00:00:19.059 --> 00:00:22.530
添加Map Remote / Add Map Remote

8
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:25.608
将目标scheme明确设为http / Explicitly set the target scheme to http

9
00:00:25.608 --> 00:00:28.612
把目标Host改为127.0.0.1 / Change target Host to 127.0.0.1

10
00:00:28.612 --> 00:00:31.668
填写另一个真实HTTP服务端口 / Enter the other actual HTTP service port

11
00:00:31.668 --> 00:00:34.649
填写remote-target路径 / Enter the remote-target path

12
00:00:34.649 --> 00:00:37.675
启用映射规则 / Enable the mapping Rule

13
00:00:37.675 --> 00:00:40.716
Apply映射 / Apply mapping

14
00:00:40.716 --> 00:00:44.263
核对HTTPS输入到HTTP目标的真实往返 / Verify HTTPS input reaches the actual HTTP destination

15
00:00:44.263 --> 00:00:47.349
返回映射规则 / Return to the mapping Rule

16
00:00:47.349 --> 00:00:50.369
停用Map Remote / Disable Map Remote

17
00:00:50.369 --> 00:00:53.387
Apply停用 / Apply disabling

18
00:00:53.387 --> 00:00:56.647
停用后恢复原HTTPS端点的404 / Restore the original HTTPS endpoint’s 404 after disabling

19
00:00:56.647 --> 00:01:09.992
获取可以由产品保存的公开正文 / Fetch the public body the product can save

20
00:01:09.992 --> 00:01:14.432
产品保存guide-map-local.json / Save guide-map-local.json through the product

21
00:01:14.432 --> 00:01:17.388
核对实际产品文件 / Verify the actual product-created file

22
00:01:17.388 --> 00:01:20.471
返回规则准备Map Local / Return to prepare Map Local

23
00:01:20.471 --> 00:01:23.486
将本段原请求Host设为127.0.0.1 / Set this example’s original Host to 127.0.0.1

24
00:01:23.486 --> 00:01:26.515
移除Map Remote动作 / Remove the Map Remote action

25
00:01:26.515 --> 00:01:29.864
添加Map Local / Add Map Local

26
00:01:29.864 --> 00:01:32.863
填写本轮不存在的文件名 / Enter the owned missing-file name

27
00:01:32.863 --> 00:01:35.873
启用Map Local / Enable Map Local

28
00:01:35.873 --> 00:01:38.933
Apply本地映射 / Apply local mapping

29
00:01:38.933 --> 00:01:42.225
核对缺失文件的真实404 / Verify the actual missing-file 404

30
00:01:42.225 --> 00:01:45.348
返回规则修正路径 / Return to correct the path

31
00:01:45.348 --> 00:01:48.348
选择同流程产品保存的实际路径 / Enter the actual path saved by this workflow

32
00:01:48.348 --> 00:01:51.383
Apply正确路径 / Apply the correct path

33
00:01:51.383 --> 00:01:54.616
核对实际文件替换与源站未调用 / Verify file replacement without calling the origin

34
00:01:54.616 --> 00:01:57.740
返回规则收尾 / Return to the Rule for cleanup

35
00:01:57.740 --> 00:02:00.768
停用映射规则 / Disable the mapping Rule

36
00:02:00.768 --> 00:02:03.810
Apply最终停用 / Apply final disabling

37
00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:06.865
进入Certificates恢复本轮TLS设置 / Open Certificates to restore this run’s TLS settings

38
00:02:06.865 --> 00:02:09.883
关闭本轮解密 / Disable this run’s decryption

39
00:02:09.883 --> 00:02:13.108
移除localhost源站例外 / Remove the localhost origin exception
